    "complete_payload_interpretation": "Python3 maintenance command, not Lean source. It scans unannotated set_option patterns, can edit lakefile.lean, attempts all removals then per-line removals with builds, records file hashes, restores the original text on BaseException, and schedules downstream-first work across the full import DAG. It supports resume, per-module/global timeouts and progress display. The no-target early return deletes an existing progress file even before the dry-run return path; the review does not assert dry-run is side-effect-free."
